  "name": "AP – Demo clean-up",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "note-demo-clean-up",
      "name": "Note: Demo clean-up",
      "parameters": {
        "color": 5,
        "content": "## Demo clean-up\nEvery 5 minutes, what a **public demo session** leaves behind is deleted once it ends (60 minutes after it starts).\n\nThe **core** deletes the session's invoices, files and data, and lists what is held elsewhere: its Gmail messages and the records of the n8n runs that handled its files. n8n deletes them **permanently** (no trash) and reports each answer; the core decides what is gone and what is tried again. A refused demo email is listed at once.",
        "height": 350,
        "width": 1620
      },
      "position": [
        -40,
        -150
      ],
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "note-ask-the-core",
      "name": "Note: Ask the core",
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "content": "## Ask the core\nEnded sessions are deleted in the database; the answer lists what to delete elsewhere and the files still waiting.",
        "height": 350,
        "width": 660
      },
      "position": [
        -40,
        250
      ],
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "note-delete-permanently",
      "name": "Note: Delete permanently",
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "content": "## Delete permanently\nGmail API: the message is deleted, not moved to the trash. n8n API: the run record and its stored files. The **status code** goes to the core (404 = already gone).",
        "height": 550,
        "width": 900
      },
      "position": [
        680,
        250
      ],
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "note-missed-files",
      "name": "Note: Missed files",
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "content": "## Missed files\nA file still queued a minute after it was sent (the demo page's call didn't reach n8n) is processed now, one run each.",
        "height": 350,
        "width": 420
      },
      "position": [
        680,
        850
      ],
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "note-no-answer",
      "name": "Note: No answer",
      "parameters": {
        "color": 3,
        "content": "## No answer\nThe core did not answer: the run fails (logged by the error workflow); the next run tries again.",
        "height": 350,
        "width": 420
      },
      "position": [
        -40,
        850
      ],
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "every-5-minutes",
